,"不提供無障礙座位"]],[0,"不提供無障礙座位","無障礙座位","不提供無障礙座位"]],1,[2],0],["/geo/type/establishment_poi/has_wheelchair_accessible_parking","無障礙停車場",[1,[[0,"不提供無障礙停車場"]],[0,"不提供無障礙停車場","無障礙停車場","不提供無障礙停車場"]],1,[2],0]]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"zh-TW",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,0,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[9],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[["定置漁場三代目—\n優先選用來自東海岸定置漁場的魚，\n經過六到八小時的熬煮，\n煮出一碗最能呈現海洋風味的魚湯拉麵。\n\n那些隨著海流而來的日常，\n從花蓮出發，\n在不同的海風與街巷間延續著鮮味的流動。\n\nOut at sea, time moves with the tides.\nFishermen wait for the wind, follow the waves,\nand work hand in hand with the ocean.\n\nThe fish travel with the current,\nand we move in the same rhythm—\nsetting out, hauling the nets,\nbringing home the freshest catch for our broth.\n\nAt The Fishery,\nwe choose fish from the set-net fisheries along Taiwan’s eastern coast,\nsimmered for six to eight hours\nto create a bowl that captures the pure taste of the sea.\n\nThese everyday moments that drift with the current\nbegin in Hualien,\nand continue their flow of flavor\nthrough every sea breeze and quiet street."],["https://www.google.com/local/place/rap/merchantdescription","https://support.google.com/legal/troubleshooter/1114905#ts\u003d1115658%2C1115689"]],null,null,"https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/-rhCXvlu7kgY/AAAAAAAAAAI/AAAAAAAAAAA/8fj5He5uSow/s44-p-k-no-ns-nd/photo.jpg",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[1],"臺北市中山區康樂里",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[null,[null,1],0,null,["評分和評論","分享你的經驗供他人參考",1,"詳細說明你在這個地點的親身體驗"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[3,1,null,null,null,[2]]],null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,null,null,null,"6787760459440062479","102812659648524699526"],null,[[[7,[["定置漁場三代目 The Fishery 中山"],["104臺北市中山區康樂里中山北路二段39巷22號"]]],[2,[["104臺北市中山區康樂里中山北路二段39巷22號定置漁場三代目 The Fishery 中山"]]],[1,[["104臺北市中山區康樂里中山北路二段39巷22號"]]],[4,[["臺北市中山區康樂里"]]]],[null,"中山北路二段39巷22號","中山北路二段39巷22